  "html": "<p>These are monsters that appear to be partially human.  They may appear human but may be of extremely large size, have a pale or non-human skin tone, no pupils, pointy ears, have wings or even be part animal or some other mythical creature.  What is generally the case, however is that the human parts that do exist are roughly in proportion to each other.\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-subcategories\">\n<h2>Subcategories</h2>\n<p>There are 4 subcategories to this category.\n</p><h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Angel\" title=\"Category:Angel\">Angel</a></li></ul><h3>H</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Humanoids\" title=\"Category:Humanoids\">Humanoids</a></li></ul><h3>L</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Lava_Rachnid\" title=\"Category:Lava Rachnid\">Lava Rachnid</a></li></ul><h3>R</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Raythe\" title=\"Category:Raythe\">Raythe</a></li></ul>\n</div><div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Demi-Humans\"</h2>\n<p>There are 35 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>1</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/1/2_Slacker\" title=\"1/2 Slacker\">1/2 Slacker</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Aba-_Champions\" title=\"Aba- Champions\">Aba- Champions</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon\" title=\"Abaddon\">Abaddon</a></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon's_Guard_%28Caster%29\" title=\"Abaddon's Guard (Caster)\">Abaddon's Guard (Caster)</a></span></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon's_Guard_%28Melee%29\" title=\"Abaddon's Guard (Melee)\">Abaddon's Guard (Melee)</a></span></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Angel\" title=\"Angel\">Angel</a></li></ul>\n<h3>B</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bobby_Pickaxe\" title=\"Bobby Pickaxe\">Bobby Pickaxe</a></li></ul>\n<h3>C</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Chairman_Manchair\" title=\"Chairman Manchair\">Chairman Manchair</a></li></ul>\